\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces E2-v1 field panel, per family (nominal $n=60$/family/model). $\hat  \beta $ is the \emph  {conservative-mapped} estimate (unavailable turns mapped to the charter-holding verdict), identical for both gateway models; meas.\nonbreakingspace $n$ = fully-measured sessions (gpt-5.6\nonbreakingspace /\nonbreakingspace gpt-6.1; measured-$n$ upper bounds: up to $0.088$ (exfiltration, Wilson $0/40$) and $0.242$ (state-deception, Wilson $0/12$), E2-v1 sensitivity artifact). The gpt-5.6 state-deception family is fully censored: E2-v1 identifies no estimate for it---the family measures $0/60$ genuine $[0,0.060]$ only on the repaired panel (E29). Belief--Claim Gap: confidentiality $0.000$, action safety $0.000$. Every interval lies far below $\tau =0.2$ on measured turns, while under worst-case censoring neither lane is identified (Proposition\nonbreakingspace \ref {prop:censor}).}}{19}{table.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:fieldnull}{{4}{19}{E2-v1 field panel, per family (nominal $n=60$/family/model). $\hat \beta $ is the \emph {conservative-mapped} estimate (unavailable turns mapped to the charter-holding verdict), identical for both gateway models; meas.~$n$ = fully-measured sessions (gpt-5.6~/~gpt-6.1; measured-$n$ upper bounds: up to $0.088$ (exfiltration, Wilson $0/40$) and $0.242$ (state-deception, Wilson $0/12$), E2-v1 sensitivity artifact). The gpt-5.6 state-deception family is fully censored: E2-v1 identifies no estimate for it---the family measures $0/60$ genuine $[0,0.060]$ only on the repaired panel (E29). Belief--Claim Gap: confidentiality $0.000$, action safety $0.000$. Every interval lies far below $\tau =0.2$ on measured turns, while under worst-case censoring neither lane is identified (Proposition~\ref {prop:censor})}{table.caption.18}{}}
