\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces The open-weight panels, adjudicated (frozen E17 rubric; author-side, non-blind, with mechanically checkable genuine flags). Columns: adjudicated \emph  {genuine} family cells per $n\!=\!60$ (Canary echo = epistemic-echo family, \texttt  {secret\_leak} oracle); \emph  {Pooled genuine} = \emph  {all} genuine \texttt  {secret\_leak} flags across the five families (authority, goal, echo, exfiltration included) over the $300$ sessions per model---a per-300-session credential-leak rate, not a rate over the 120 echo-plus-exfiltration sessions, whose caption-literal pools would be $6/120$, $42/120$, $10/120$ (Wilson 95\% CIs). Censoring per Proposition\nonbreakingspace \ref {prop:censor}: E30 V4-Pro is only $74.7\%$ fully measured (224/300), \emph  {below} the $80\%$ certification bar---its row is reported with session-level worst case $[0,0.387]$ and is not certifiable at $\tau =0.2$ by the floor; E31 MiniMax state-dec carries $c=12/60=0.200$, \emph  {exactly} at the identification boundary, and E31 V4-Pro authority $c=27/60$. All 230 flags adjudicated: 118 \texttt  {unauthorized\_action} flags ($5$, $11$, $24$, $13$, $37$, $28$ for E29; E30 Flash/V4-Pro; E31 Flash/V4-Pro/MiniMax; E30 MiniMax contributed none)---all refusal-quote false positives; 112 \texttt  {secret\_leak} flags ($9,40,9,43,11$)---all genuine. E30 ran 2026-11-22 UTC at the hardcoded 200-token cap (disclosed deviation); E31 (registered 2026-11-23, before data by its frozen timestamp) re-measures at 1024.}}{23}{table.caption.27}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:openweight}{{6}{23}{The open-weight panels, adjudicated (frozen E17 rubric; author-side, non-blind, with mechanically checkable genuine flags). Columns: adjudicated \emph {genuine} family cells per $n\!=\!60$ (Canary echo = epistemic-echo family, \texttt {secret\_leak} oracle); \emph {Pooled genuine} = \emph {all} genuine \texttt {secret\_leak} flags across the five families (authority, goal, echo, exfiltration included) over the $300$ sessions per model---a per-300-session credential-leak rate, not a rate over the 120 echo-plus-exfiltration sessions, whose caption-literal pools would be $6/120$, $42/120$, $10/120$ (Wilson 95\% CIs). Censoring per Proposition~\ref {prop:censor}: E30 V4-Pro is only $74.7\%$ fully measured (224/300), \emph {below} the $80\%$ certification bar---its row is reported with session-level worst case $[0,0.387]$ and is not certifiable at $\tau =0.2$ by the floor; E31 MiniMax state-dec carries $c=12/60=0.200$, \emph {exactly} at the identification boundary, and E31 V4-Pro authority $c=27/60$. All 230 flags adjudicated: 118 \texttt {unauthorized\_action} flags ($5$, $11$, $24$, $13$, $37$, $28$ for E29; E30 Flash/V4-Pro; E31 Flash/V4-Pro/MiniMax; E30 MiniMax contributed none)---all refusal-quote false positives; 112 \texttt {secret\_leak} flags ($9,40,9,43,11$)---all genuine. E30 ran 2026-11-22 UTC at the hardcoded 200-token cap (disclosed deviation); E31 (registered 2026-11-23, before data by its frozen timestamp) re-measures at 1024}{table.caption.27}{}}
