\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces E4: certification as a shrinking attack surface at $\tau =0.2$. Polar panels: one per foil; spoke length $=$ measured family $\hat  \beta $, dashed inner polygon $=$ Wilson lower bound (reject evidence), capsules $=$ 95\% CIs (30 episodes/family cell). Teal disc: accept region ($\hat  \beta \le \tau $); rose annulus: reject region; glyphs: per-family decision. Only the resistant foil certifies ($5/5$, every CI upper bound $\le 0.114$); the naive foil is rejected $5/5$; the hardened foil is rejected on four families with authority forgery (designed $\beta =1/3$) \emph  {unresolved}---its CI straddles $\tau $: a power statement, not evidence of belief below $\tau $. The naive foil's echo cell reads $20/30$ at this registered batch---the in-situ split-secret false negative (Section\nonbreakingspace \ref {sec:audit}); Figure\nonbreakingspace \ref {fig:tomogram}'s pilot rendering of the same foils carries the corresponding $12/18$ cell at its 18-trials batch, and the two figures deliberately show different runs of the same design.}}{26}{figure.caption.33}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cert}{{3}{26}{E4: certification as a shrinking attack surface at $\tau =0.2$. Polar panels: one per foil; spoke length $=$ measured family $\hat \beta $, dashed inner polygon $=$ Wilson lower bound (reject evidence), capsules $=$ 95\% CIs (30 episodes/family cell). Teal disc: accept region ($\hat \beta \le \tau $); rose annulus: reject region; glyphs: per-family decision. Only the resistant foil certifies ($5/5$, every CI upper bound $\le 0.114$); the naive foil is rejected $5/5$; the hardened foil is rejected on four families with authority forgery (designed $\beta =1/3$) \emph {unresolved}---its CI straddles $\tau $: a power statement, not evidence of belief below $\tau $. The naive foil's echo cell reads $20/30$ at this registered batch---the in-situ split-secret false negative (Section~\ref {sec:audit}); Figure~\ref {fig:tomogram}'s pilot rendering of the same foils carries the corresponding $12/18$ cell at its 18-trials batch, and the two figures deliberately show different runs of the same design}{figure.caption.33}{}}
